Z||000009||william_thorniii||01-25-2000||08:59 PM||||Phil,<P>Here comes the flack.  Monkeyman is a great individual and often mentions that he is only joking about the drugs.  He is adamently against their use which cannot be said for most people.  Perhaps if you paid a little more attention, you wouldn't need to be pulling that foot out of your mouth.  <P>Now that aside, I do agree with your ideology.  I neither condone nor appreciate the use of drugs for entertainment.  That does not mean that many of my friends do not participate in the consumption of illegal substances.  Nor does that mean that those individuals should be persecuted for their actions.  What you must remember is that to some (as Patrick noted) your killing of a living, breathing being is as repulsive as others consumption of illegal substances is to you.  Moral of the story:  Let's try to keep this friendly!  Afterall the friendly atmosphere is what keeps us regulars coming back.<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
