Z||000013||fiero56||01-25-2000||09:36 PM||||I am strongly against the use of drugs. But I also see the problem will never stop. I recall several months ago someone complaining that when his Fiero was either stolen or broken into the cops were too busy trying to track down drugs than to care about his car problems. He then made a comment about how he cares more about his car, than some stoned guy eating fritos in the corner of his living room causing no harm to anyone but himself. I too would rather have the cops helping me than find stoned individuals in their living rooms. Now, if they are driving, thats a different story.<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 01-25-2000).]||||reg||1
