Z||000016||Phaeton||01-26-2000||01:57 AM||||Got to sliding on a corner the other day, I was riding on that hard ridge of snow that builds up outside the ruts on the highway (you southern folks can't imagine) trying to slow down without the front end doing the straight line trick.  Adrenaline rush! WOW!  After it was over I felt faint and weak.  Folks that use recreational drugs just need a Fiero.||||reg||1
