Z||000023||william_thorniii||01-26-2000||10:18 PM||||Phil and Monkey,<P>For the record, I still disagree.  I feel that this is a good part of the Forum... HUMOR... after all that is what keeps some of us here for hours at a time. I realize that not everyone's idea of humor is the same, however, the majority of forum members are neither children nor are they offended by the joking about medications.  Monkey do as you feel is right, although I for one would definitely miss your off the wall comments justified by your needing of your medications!<P>William T. Thorn, III<P>Phil also if you are interested, I probably consume the equivalent of a case of beer/year.  I do not do any illegal drugs now nor have I ever.  What you must realize is that people have to make up their own minds about what they want to do.  Reading jokes about taking medications will not influence an intelligent individual as I am sure that your son is.  ||||reg||10
