Z||000033||william_thorniii||01-27-2000||04:20 PM||||Monkey,<P>My dad is an accountant.  So no, the van does not have a CD player.  Not to mention that the huge dustbuster only has 6 rather oddly placed speakers.  You know all about the quality of factory speakers so I guess the saying "The louder, the muddier and more distorted." would be more apt, but it doesn't sound nearly as good.  It is definitely not a good cruising machine.  I could probably find a portable and cassette adapter for our trek though.  My 6 disk changer could possibly be controlled if we could get one of these forum electricians to help us out!<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
